SUMMARY:Webinar | MAESTRO: Threat Modelling for Agentic AI
DESCRIPTION:<p>The rise of Agentic AI — autonomous systems capable of perceiving their environment\, making decisions\, and taking actions to achieve goals — introduces a fundamentally new threat landscape that traditional security frameworks were never designed to address. When multiple AI agents interact\, learn\, and operate with increasing autonomy\, risks like goal manipulation\, agent impersonation\, data […]</p>\\n | Source: WiCyS Events | Tags: risk\, security | https://www.wicys.org/event/webinar-maestro-threat-modelling-for-agentic-ai/
