SUMMARY:OWASP NYC Chapter IAM Summit 2026 Event
DESCRIPTION:OWASP New York City Chapter *OWASP NYC Chapter Summer IAM Summit 2026 @ Ease Building **July 23\, 2026** Join us for this Informative IAM Event. Use code* Professional Session with OWASPVIP *for our special VIP Complimentary Ticket. Please put OWASP NYC after your last name to confirm you’re a OWASP NYC Member. Everyone is welcomed.* **[http://url.clutchevents.co/OWASP01](http://url.clutchevents.co/OWASP01)** *Use code* Professional Session with OWASPVIP *for our special Complimentary Ticket.* Join us for the inaugural New York City edition of the Summer IAM Summit to explore the latest in security and compliance through expert-led sessions and interactive discussions. Connect with peers\, address real-world IAM challenges\, and gain practical insights to strengthen your organization's digital identity strategy.Admission offers attendees access to all interactive panels\, discussions\, **IAM Happy Hour - Come network and unwind with your peers for a couple of drinks on us! @4:00 pm** @Ease Building 1345 6th Avenue New York\, NY 10105 (54th /55th and Avenue of the Americas) Come join Zoe\, Carlos and Guy\, all OWASP NYC Members are welcome. | Source: OWASP NYC Meetup | Tags: application security\, compliance\, security | https://www.meetup.com/owasp-new-york-city-chapter/events/315378372/
LOCATION:
URL:https://www.meetup.com/owasp-new-york-city-chapter/events/315378372/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:b44a545d14152751@zcyber-gtm.local
DTSTAMP:20260720T160039Z
DTSTART:20260723T090000Z
DTEND:20260723T100000Z
SUMMARY:Webinar | From Security Policies to Security Decisions: How AI Agents Can Operationalize Security at Scale
DESCRIPTION:<p>As organizations grow\, security teams are challenged to consistently apply policies\, controls\, and best practices across an ever-increasing number of applications and technology platforms. This session explores how AI agents can help transform security knowledge (policies\, standards\, controls\, vulnerabilities findings) into actionable security decisions\, enabling organizations to scale security reviews\, control validation\, and risk identification […]</p>\\n | Source: WiCyS Events | Tags: risk\, security | https://www.wicys.org/event/webinar-from-security-policies-to-security-decisions-how-ai-agents-can-operationalize-security-at-scale/
LOCATION:BrightTALK
URL:https://www.wicys.org/event/webinar-from-security-policies-to-security-decisions-how-ai-agents-can-operationalize-security-at-scale/
END:VEVENT
