SUMMARY:Chicago CyberRisk Collaborative Q3 CISO Dinner
DESCRIPTION:The Chicago CyberRisk Collaborative Leadership Board is excited to invite the Chicago area CISO community to join them at their next Chicago CISO Dinner. This event has been curated by the Chicago Leadership Board and is for senior-level cybersecurity executives (CISO\, equivalent or direct report/deputy) at enterprise companies and is complimentary to qualified attendees. Apply to Attend: https://events.cyberriskcollaborative.com/augus-2026-chicago-ciso-dinner/register OR reach out directly to Todd Bratulich at todd.bratulich@cyberriskalliance.com<mailto:todd.bratulich@cyberriskalliance.com> 📅Date: Tuesday\, August 25\, 2026 ⌚Time: 5-9pm (see schedule below) 📍Location: Gibson’s Bar & Steakhouse (5464 N River Rd\, Rosemont\, IL 60018) 🅿️Parking: Complimentary Valet Parking available at front entrance. Featured Speaker: Michael Myint\, 4X CISO (Topic coming soon!) Schedule/Agenda: 5pm Networking/Happy Hour 6pm Welcome & Opening Comments 6:15 Featured CISO Presentation 6:45 Dinner & Roundtable Discussions 7:45 Key Takeaways & Reminders 8:00 Networking Reception | Source: Chicago InfoSec Events Calendar | Tags: ciso\, cyber\, cybersecurity\, infosec\, risk\, security | https://events.cyberriskcollaborative.com/augus-2026-chicago-ciso-dinner/register
LOCATION:Gibsons Bar & Steakhouse (5464 N River Rd\, Rosemont\, IL 60018)
URL:https://events.cyberriskcollaborative.com/augus-2026-chicago-ciso-dinner/register
END:VEVENT
