BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:188bf7ed677c13c1@zcyber-gtm.local
DTSTAMP:20260720T160039Z
DTSTART:20260827T180000Z
DTEND:20260827T235500Z
SUMMARY:BurbSec East - Sponsored by Akamai!
DESCRIPTION:BurbSec Chicago: The Midwest's Favorite Cybersecurity Events This month's sponsor is [AKAMAI!](https://ww.akamai.com) 🚀🔐 **Unlock the Excitement at Burbsec!** 🍻🎉 Are you ready for a night of geeking out\, making new friends\, and expanding your network in the world of infosec? Look no further—Burbsec East is the place to be\, and everyone is welcome! We have **NO DUES\, NO PRESENTATIONS\, and NO PUSHY SALESPEOPLE OR RECRUITERS!** 👥 **A Community Just Like You:** We're just like you\, and you'll fit right in! Whether you're passionate about infosec\, love indulging in memes\, enjoy a good beer\, or appreciate compliance jokes (among other things)\, we've got you covered. Our diverse skill set ranges from novice to expert\, and yes\, we even dabble in paper hat making! 🎩✨ 🤝 **Connections That Matter:** At Burbsec East\, you'll find more than just like-minded people. You'll make valuable contacts\, form genuine friendships\, and expand your network of professional connections. These are the kinds of connections that come in handy when you're tackling that thorny problem at work\, at home\, or in the job market. 💡 **Knowledge Exchange:** Whether you're seeking answers to tough questions or ready to share your expertise\, there's always someone at Burbsec East who's got your back. We thrive in a collaborative atmosphere where knowledge flows freely\, and camaraderie is key. 🕕 **Flexible Timing:** Don't worry about being fashionably late! People will start rolling in after work around 6 pm\, and we keep the vibe going until we're done (generally 4-6 hours) 🌐 **Stay Connected:** Don't miss out on the latest updates and community banter! Join the BurbSec Discord and follow us on Twitter for all the behind-the-scenes action and event sneak peeks. **Information Superhighway World Wide Web Presence:** Discord: [(](%5D(https%3A//discord.gg/zfkTdnTf)%5Bhttps://discord.gg/4hhVPHebJX%5D(https://discord.gg/4hhVPHebJX)%5B)](https://discord.gg/zfkTdnTf) Web: ([http://burbsec.com/](http://burbsec.com/)) Twitter: [@burbseceast](https://www.x.com/burbseceast) BlueSky:[ @east.burbsec.com](https://bsky.app/profile/east.burbsec.com) | Source: BurbSec Chicago | Tags: compliance\, cyber\, cybersecurity\, infosec\, security | https://www.meetup.com/burbsec/events/313768578/
LOCATION:
URL:https://www.meetup.com/burbsec/events/313768578/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:56ef28c9f8b95d33@zcyber-gtm.local
DTSTAMP:20260720T160039Z
DTSTART:20260827T180000Z
DTEND:20260827T200000Z
SUMMARY:Burbsec Northwest - Sponsors Welcome!
DESCRIPTION:BurbSec Chicago: The Midwest's Favorite Cybersecurity Events 🚀🔐 **Unlock the Excitement at Burbsec Northwest!** 🍻🎉 Are you ready for a night of geeking out\, making new friends\, and expanding your network in the world of infosec? Look no further—Burbsec Northwest is the place to be\, and everyone is welcome! We have **NO DUES\, NO PRESENTATIONS\, and NO PUSHY SALESPEOPLE OR RECRUITERS!** [Crystal Lake Brewing](http://crystallakebrew.com/)\, at the address below\, has a full bar\, but you will need to **BYO food** if you need dinner. 👥 **A Community Just Like You:** We're just like you\, and you'll fit right in! Whether you're passionate about infosec\, love indulging in memes\, enjoy a good beer\, or appreciate compliance jokes (among other things)\, we've got you covered. Our diverse skill set ranges from novice to expert\, and yes\, we even dabble in paper hat making! 🎩✨ 🤝 **Connections That Matter:** At Burbsec Northwest\, you'll find more than just like-minded people. You'll make valuable contacts\, form genuine friendships\, and expand your network of professional connections. These are the kinds of connections that come in handy when you're tackling that thorny problem at work\, at home\, or in the job market. 💡 **Knowledge Exchange:** Whether you're seeking answers to tough questions or ready to share your expertise\, there's always someone at Burbsec Northwest who's got your back. We thrive in a collaborative atmosphere where knowledge flows freely\, and camaraderie is key. 🕕 **Flexible Timing:** Don't worry about being fashionably late! People will start rolling in after work around 6 pm\, and we keep the vibe going until we're done (generally 2-3 hours) 🌐 **Stay Connected:** Don't miss out on the latest updates and community banter! Join the BurbSec Discord and follow us on Twitter for all the behind-the-scenes action and event sneak peeks. **Information Superhighway World Wide Web Presence:** BurbSec Discord: [https://discord.gg/4hhVPHebJX](https://discord.gg/4hhVPHebJX) Web: http://burbsec.com ([http://burbsec.com/](http://burbsec.com/)) Twitter: @burbsecnw ([https://www.twitter.com/burbsecnw](https://www.twitter.com/burbsecnw)) Mastodon: burbsecnw@infosec.exchange [(https://infosec.exchange/@burbsecnw](https://infosec.exchange/@burbsecnw)) | Source: BurbSec Chicago | Tags: compliance\, cyber\, cybersecurity\, infosec\, security | https://www.meetup.com/burbsec/events/lxplwtyjclbkc/
LOCATION:
URL:https://www.meetup.com/burbsec/events/lxplwtyjclbkc/
END:VEVENT
